OL,3,GNEWSACare home still needs improvement,
OL,4,Ainspectors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home that was previously told to
OL,7,Fimprove is no longer breaching
OL,8,Fregulations but more work is needed,
OL,9,Finspectors have said.
OL,11,FThe Lodge, in Old London Road, Copdock,
OL,12,FIpswich, was told it required
OL,13,Fimprovement and that it was in breach
OL,14,Fof regulation relating to governance
OL,15,Fand safety by the Care Quality
OL,16,FCommission (CQC) in March.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
