OL,3,GNEWSACare home still needs improvement,
OL,4,Ainspectors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors visited the service again in
OL,7,FJuly and found it was on "an improving
OL,8,Fjourney and they were no longer in
OL,9,Fbreach of regulation" related to
OL,10,Fsafety, but it still required
OL,11,Fimprovement.
OL,13,FGemini Care Limited, which runs the
OL,14,Fhome, was contacted for comment.
